---
// "Grandma, recording": pink avatar with a microphone. The label is real text.
---

<div class="avatar">
  <div class="avatar__disc" aria-hidden="true">
    <span class="avatar__head"></span>
    <span class="avatar__body"></span>
  </div>
  <span class="avatar__mic" aria-hidden="true">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="60%" height="60%" focusable="false">
      <rect x="9" y="3" width="6" height="11" rx="3" fill="#14161B"></rect>
      <path d="M6 11a6 6 0 0 0 12 0M12 17v4M8.5 21h7" fill="none" stroke="#14161B" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
    </svg>
  </span>
  <span class="avatar__label"><span class="avatar__rec" aria-hidden="true"></span>Grandma, recording</span>
</div>
